        "created_at": "2017-08-02T15:05:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have a question about a fear card whose name I can’t remember - something to do with overseas trade. It’s level II effect stops the invaders from building cities in coastal lands, and there was a disagreement about what exactly this meant - if invaders would build a city, do they instead build a town, or nothing at all?</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
